WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
The eldest sister’s mother-in-law is a standard old ex-wife

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,320
Not only monitoring customers

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:05,280
She also made things difficult for her elder sister and elder brother-in-law.

4
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:06,720
The reason why the eldest brother-in-law keeps helping the two of them

5
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:07,880
The delicious and lazy brother

6
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,840
Of course it was all forced by her

7
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,160
I didn't live up to expectations in my previous life

8
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,840
I took advantage of a lot with the help of my eldest sister and eldest brother-in-law.

9
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,240
But at least I don't have a bowl to eat with.

10
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:16,010
Put down the bowl and curse

11
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,130
I advise you to see the reality clearly.

12
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:19,290
My elder brother is in this situation now

13
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:21,010
It seems that ten days are running out

14
00:00:21,010 --> 00:00:23,050
Hand over Sha Yufu obediently

15
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:24,970
Maybe we are temporarily soft-hearted

16
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:27,290
Can you still be allowed to stay in our Li family as a widower?

17
00:00:27,290 --> 00:00:28,290
Li Qinghe

18
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:29,610
Are you still speaking in human language?

19
00:00:29,610 --> 00:00:34,240
I'm not dead yet, mother

20
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,800
I am also your biological son

21
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,280
How could you bear to do this to me?

22
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,040
I'm usually so filial to you

23
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:40,780
Help two younger brothers

24
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:42,060
As a result, you were in my death

25
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:43,420
The first moment after escaping

26
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:44,460
rush into my house

27
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:46,700
O beat my wife and force me to hand over

28
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:48,460
You Sha Yufu who live on a rotten chair

29
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:51,810
Do you still have a conscience?

30
00:00:51,810 --> 00:00:54,210
Have I not been good enough to you before?

31
00:00:54,210 --> 00:00:56,250
Has your conscience been eaten by dogs?
